  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> faint Enhancement; <strong>CL</strong> 2nd<br>\n<strong>Slot</strong> none; <strong>Price</strong> 1,600 gp; <strong>Weight</strong> 3 lbs.</p>\n<p>This bottle contains a faintly shimmering lime-green liquid that occasionally switches to another bright color for a moment. When consumed as a standard action, this liquid grants a +5 enhancement bonus to 1 skill of the drinker’s choice for one round per caster level. The bottle refills itself once each day, usually sometime late in the afternoon. Rumors exist of greater versions of this item that last for minutes per caster level, as well as a superior bottle with a permanent extend spell effect applied on top of that.</p>\n<p><strong>Flask Shard Effect:</strong> Increase the caster level of this item to the next increment of 4, increase its uses per day by 1, and increase the enhancement bonus it provides by +1. <strong>Flask Shard Limit:</strong> +4</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nCraft Marvelous Item, Enhancement sphere (Enhance Focus (enhance)); <strong>Cost</strong> 800 gp</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/marvelous-items#toc60\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
